:14:13.226Z","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","title":{"value":"La grande illusione","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"La Grande Illusion","overview":{"value":"Scene da un campo di prigionia tedesco durante la Grande Guerra. Un ufficiale francese di origine aristocratica si sacrifica per favorire la fuga di due suoi subalterni di origine popolare. Specchio del francese è il tedesco comandante del campo, anch'egli di vecchio stampo, minato nel fisico e nel morale. Entrambi incarnano un mondo destinato a scomparire mentre i fuggiaschi sono metafora della nuova società. Capolavoro del cinema antimilitarista, manifesto malinconico e pacifista di una generazione in via di estinzione.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"A Great Drama of Human Emotions","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1937-06-18","status":"Released","rating":7.9,"ratingCount":809,"genres":["Dramma","Storia","Guerra"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"114m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":11544,"name":"Jean Gabin","role":"Lieutenant Maréchal","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pmFuOVTQvYdgmN7cYOuyJHPfMRt.jpg"},{"id":11545,"name":"Dita Parlo","role":"Elsa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kbCBLwzBRgbb91mi5vjnnDWOzlM.jpg"},{"id":11546,"name":"Pierre Fresnay","role":"Captain de Boëldieu","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i9tbRMDTM5x2L5d2zTpR0l85SVt.jpg"},{"id":8630,"name":"Erich von Stroheim","role":"Captain von Rauffenstein","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lUoSEdmX6Cl7lLUnV4ewLkVDnhY.jpg"},{"id":11541,"name":"Julien Carette","role":"Cartier, the Vaudeville Performer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9QD6WW8DPZDtHEO7d26EXu2C0nM.jpg"},{"id":11548,"name":"Georges Péclet","role":"Officer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Ll0PBipZo7T4sIzItQSFSnLlnw.jpg"},{"id":11549,"name":"Werner Florian","role":"Sergeant Arthur"},{"id":11550,"name":"Jean Dasté","role":"Teacher","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j85NbYeqdwOqjcJ7uviE19cf1dt.jpg"},{"id":11551,"name":"Sylvain Itkine","role":"Lieutenant Demolder"},{"id":11543,"name":"Gaston Modot","role":"Engineer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6XEN6LX7stfMhnLi7ng0qkwfHJ6.jpg"},{"id":4121,"name":"Marcel Dalio","role":"Lieutenant Rosenthal","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yYZMbAl56e5S7uFbiFbj0YziIDB.jpg"},{"id":103393,"name":"Jacques Becker","role":"British Officer (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wamZsli0mJPyWeZ6bwSgdzsvHyi.jpg"},{"id":1118636,"name":"Habib Benglia","role":"Senegalese (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8zmgr2NE5NkVcRUvW7EcnlXa75H.jpg"},{"id":579731,"name":"Pierre Blondy","role":"Soldier (uncredited)"},{"id":1890119,"name":"Albert Brouett","role":"Prisoner (uncredited)"},{"id":1460969,"name":"Géo Forster","role":"Maison-Neuve (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/633UNtzpzrfaVoTmbe4UuyjW2bD.jpg"},{"id":1063455,"name":"Georges Fronval","role":"German Soldier Who Kills Captain de Boëldieu (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iLGnz6mNIERPfBWZWGQ3oGXyCU9.jpg"},{"id":1395527,"name":"Karl Heil","role":"Officer of the Fortress (uncredited)"},{"id":11529,"name":"Carl Koch","role":"Von Rauffenstein's Orderly (uncredited)"},{"id":1997758,"name":"Little Peters","role":"Elsa's Daughter (uncredited)"},{"id":150918,"name":"Claude Sainval","role":"Captain Ringis (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3oCNDVj8hmtTGJrwwjcIN4kXufS.jpg"},{"id":583366,"name":"Michel Salina","role":"(uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b2nx0dI4tUA6QZpdpUzNpMyZmop.jpg"},{"id":24779,"name":"Claude Vernier","role":"Prussian Officer (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fGipnBH6XZhL26dMQXZgk8boE14.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La grande illusione","overview":"Scene da un campo di prigionia tedesco durante la Grande Guerra. Un ufficiale francese di origine aristocratica si sacrifica per favorire la fuga di due suoi subalterni di origine popolare. Specchio del francese è il tedesco comandante del campo, anch'egli di vecchio stampo, minato nel fisico e nel morale. Entrambi incarnano un mondo destinato a scomparire mentre i fuggiaschi sono metafora della nuova società. Capolavoro del cinema antimilitarista, manifesto malinconico e pacifista di una generazione in via di estinzione."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Grand Illusion","overview":"A group of French soldiers, including the patrician Captain de Boeldieu and the working-class Lieutenant Maréchal, grapple with their own class differences after being captured and held in a World War I German prison camp. When the men are transferred to a high-security fortress, they must concoct a plan to escape beneath the watchful eye of aristocratic German officer von Rauffenstein, who has formed an unexpected bond with de Boeldieu.","tagline":"A Great Drama of Human Emotions"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Pendant la Première Guerre mondiale, l'avion du lieutenant Maréchal et du capitaine de Boëldieu est abattu par le commandant von Rauffenstein. Les deux officiers français sont envoyés dans un camp en Allemagne. Ils y retrouvent d'autres prisonniers français, de tous grades et issus de différents milieux sociaux. Les prisonniers organisent différentes activités, partagent leurs maigres ressources et vivent au rythme des nouvelles de l'armée française. La chambrée, outre Maréchal et Boëldieu, regroupe également le lieutenant Demolder, un amoureux des lettres, le lieutenant Rosenthal, fils d'une riche famille juive dans les finances, un ingénieur du cadastre et Cartier, un sergent populaire et volubile. Ils décident de s'échapper du Lager en creusant un tunnel dans des conditions périlleuses. La veille de leur évasion, le sort veut qu'ils soient transférés dans un autre camp.","tagline":"Un grand drame d'émotions humaines"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/otvWDn5lTa1VyzXuC0GTfXbr70O.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xjl0yrBwzO1ZOEK8CuIDsD4Ti33.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":777,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/otvWDn5lTa1VyzXuC0GTfXbr70O.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/otvWDn5lTa1VyzXuC0GTfXbr70O.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/otvWDn5lTa1VyzXuC0GTfXbr70O.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/otvWDn5lTa1VyzXuC0GTfXbr70O.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wVXsfyczlKv11xaqE8AZQOhM99X.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wVXsfyczlKv11xaqE8AZQOhM99X.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/86WYVeU7pzn9LfyZa6hvMxzqSNz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/86WYVeU7pzn9LfyZa6hvMxzqSNz.jpg","language":"it","width":772,"height":1100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lvge5qlPljrGiYmof57W2zZngjG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lvge5qlPljrGiYmof57W2zZngjG.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s4MQhkvpRrvab2ihfyJvaH71t6s.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s4MQhkvpRrvab2ihfyJvaH71t6s.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lWg41zE0FVixkNsFgxnlRyvDYv9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lWg41zE0FVixkNsFgxnlRyvDYv9.jpg","language":"en","width":100